WEBVTT

NOTE Paragraph timing uses generated clips; intra-paragraph timing is approximate.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
This walkthrough covers packages in the Conficius TUI.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.951
The configuration defines two profiles. Default includes storefront with npm and

00:00:09.951 --> 00:00:14.270
pnpm enabled. Work includes the API project with npm enabled.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.290
The home screen shows package updates and security

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:20.300
checks. Press p to open the profiles list.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:25.065
Choose the default profile, then open storefront from the scopes list.

00:00:25.065 --> 00:00:29.810
Profiles define the projects and package managers available in each context.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:38.740
The package list shows requested, current, and available versions, alongside security results.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:42.760
Open a package to see its version details and advisory evidence.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:54.460
The vulnerabilities view lists security findings. Open a finding to

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:58.690
see the affected package, severity, source, description, and references.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:11.117
Mark lodash for Update and axios for Bump. Update follows configured

00:01:11.117 --> 00:01:15.873
version constraints. Bump targets the latest version. The preview shows a

00:01:15.873 --> 00:01:20.630
separate command for each action. Cancel returns without applying either command.

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.300
Back to profiles. Choose work.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:29.070
Open the API scope from the work profile.

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:36.303
The package list and security findings now show the

00:01:36.303 --> 00:01:39.847
API project. This walkthrough reviewed two profiles and a

00:01:39.847 --> 00:01:43.390
mixed Update and Bump plan without changing any packages.
